 "structural_change": "s81sl_xrt3p (STW-S81c-COLLA 10-22, from s81sl_xrt3; xrt3 TT -116.66 / FF -27.91, xrt3_b TT -82.99 / FF -25.9): XR8 pin predecode (OT_S81SL_XR_PDC): kind/owner predicates decoded from the input pins into kept flags at the same edge as eb/wb/vb (578 eb -> rwe_c/rwr_c paths, input-to-reg slack +365); hold_margin 0.03 -> 0.06 ns for the zero-logic copy class (vb->vb2, x_eps_m->x_eps, FF -26..-28). Ports, cycles unchanged (bench exact PASS, hops/bwide mutants caught).",
